tools/suite_results.py is copied from kirimasim-tests
(https://github.com/kurochan001/kirimasim-tests), tools/suite_results.py at
commit 19034b575e1b715c356660ac1422b45f25c15ab3, with these changes:

- SIMULATORS lists kirimasim, verilator and ghost.
- input_files() also hashes third_party/uvm.lock, which names the library
  that every test is compiled with.
- runner_digest() hashes tools/uvm_common.py instead of normalize_output.py,
  which this suite does not use.
- The module docstring says where the file comes from.

The runners (run_*.py) and lint_metadata.py are written for this suite after
the kirimasim-tests ones; they are not copies. When the judging rules of the
two repositories start to drift, move the shared code into one package.

sv_lifetimes.py and its regression tests are also original suite code. The
helper lexically checks explicit lifetime on initialized block locals; it
is not copied from a simulator parser or the language standard.
